{"coverage":144,"partial":true,"day_closed":false,"window":"00:30–12:44","movers":[{"symbol":"ORIANA","ticker":"ORIANA","company":"Oriana Power Limited","event_type":"order_win","quantum":"approx Rs 3,870 cr over 15 years per the filing; ~140% of mcap (our arithmetic)","headline":"receives **two MSEDCL Letters of Award for 900 MW / 1,800 MWh of battery storage** in Maharashtra; the purchase agreements are not yet executed","amount_rs":null,"notability_pct":null,"marquee":null,"marquee_status":null,"pub_dt":null,"pdf_link":"https://nsearchives.nseindia.com/corporate/ORIANA_21092026083747_ORIANA_BESS_MSEDCL_210926.pdf","mcap":2756.3,"doc":"https://nsearchives.nseindia.com/corporate/ORIANA_21092026083747_ORIANA_BESS_MSEDCL_210926.pdf"},{"symbol":"PREMIERENE","ticker":"PREMIERENE","company":"Premier Energies Limited","event_type":"capex_expansion","quantum":"Rs 3,293 cr of capital expenditure per the filing; ~8.1% of mcap (our arithmetic)","headline":"commissions its **7 GW N-type TOPCon solar cell plant at Naidupeta, Andhra Pradesh**, taking total cell capacity to 10.6 GW and starting trial runs","amount_rs":null,"notability_pct":null,"marquee":null,"marquee_status":null,"pub_dt":null,"pdf_link":"https://nsearchives.nseindia.com/corporate/PEL2024_21092026081400_SE_Press_Release_Final.pdf","mcap":41671.0,"doc":"https://nsearchives.nseindia.com/corporate/PEL2024_21092026081400_SE_Press_Release_Final.pdf"},{"symbol":"DBL","ticker":"DBL","company":"Dilip Buildcon Limited","event_type":"order_win","quantum":"EPC for DBL Rs 1,265 cr excluding GST; ~18.3% of mcap (our arithmetic)","headline":"is **declared successful bidder by REC Power Development for a 400 kV GIS switching station at Solapur/Paranda**, on build-own-operate-transfer terms","amount_rs":null,"notability_pct":null,"marquee":null,"marquee_status":null,"pub_dt":null,"pdf_link":"https://nsearchives.nseindia.com/corporate/DBL_21092026104511_L1.pdf","mcap":6843.8,"doc":"https://nsearchives.nseindia.com/corporate/DBL_21092026104511_L1.pdf"},{"symbol":"GARMNTMNTR","ticker":"GARMNTMNTR","company":"Garment Mantra Lifestyle Ltd","event_type":"order_win","quantum":"approx Rs 10.37 cr (USD 1.081 mn) per the filing; ~16.0% of mcap (our arithmetic)","headline":"receives an **export order from Zaara Overseas FZE for polyester printed fabrics and cotton embroidery dress materials**, for execution by 20 January","amount_rs":null,"notability_pct":null,"marquee":null,"marquee_status":null,"pub_dt":null,"pdf_link":"https://www.bseindia.com/xml-data/corpfiling/AttachLive/47642219-d08f-4962-9ec1-bfb5d1128cef.pdf","mcap":67.1,"doc":"https://www.bseindia.com/xml-data/corpfiling/AttachLive/47642219-d08f-4962-9ec1-bfb5d1128cef.pdf"},{"symbol":"MINID","ticker":"MINID","company":"Mini Diamonds India Ltd","event_type":"order_win","quantum":"Rs 14.50 cr per the filing; ~14.6% of mcap (our arithmetic)","headline":"secures a **domestic order for cut and polished natural diamonds from an existing Mumbai-based client**; its subject line instead says Rs 14.25 cr, from Aura Diamond","amount_rs":null,"notability_pct":null,"marquee":null,"marquee_status":null,"pub_dt":null,"pdf_link":"https://www.bseindia.com/xml-data/corpfiling/AttachLive/7e1f68f1-d165-4a36-8047-649fceca8382.pdf","mcap":104.6,"doc":"https://www.bseindia.com/xml-data/corpfiling/AttachLive/7e1f68f1-d165-4a36-8047-649fceca8382.pdf"},{"symbol":"CSML","ticker":"CSML","company":"Complete Sports and Management India Ltd","event_type":"order_win","quantum":"approx Rs 24 cr; ~8.1% of mcap","headline":"bags an order to **build what it calls India's first and largest indoor go-karting track**, from a large South India-based company","amount_rs":null,"notability_pct":null,"marquee":null,"marquee_status":null,"pub_dt":null,"pdf_link":"https://www.bseindia.com/xml-data/corpfiling/AttachLive/555299d6-b4f7-47cb-af1d-ff773f245d47.pdf","mcap":357.6,"doc":"https://www.bseindia.com/xml-data/corpfiling/AttachLive/555299d6-b4f7-47cb-af1d-ff773f245d47.pdf"}],"themes":{"order_wins":["**Oriana Power** — receives **two Letters of Award dated 18 September from Maharashtra State Electricity Distribution for an aggregate 900 MW / 1,800 MWh of battery energy storage**, at Rs 2,38,000 and Rs 2,40,000 per MW per month, worth approximately Rs 3,870 crore over the 15-year purchase-agreement term _(~140% of mcap, our arithmetic)_.","**Dilip Buildcon** — **declared the successful bidder by REC Power Development and Consultancy for a 400 kV GIS switching station at Solapur/Paranda, Maharashtra**, on build-own-operate-transfer terms with 24 months of construction; the filing puts the EPC scope at Rs 1,265 crore excluding GST _(~18.3% of mcap, our arithmetic)_.","**Kothari Industrial Corporation** — receives a **Letter of Acceptance from Tiruppur City Municipal Corporation to supply the Perunthalaivar Kamarajar morning breakfast scheme to school children**, at Rs 9.08 per packet, the Rs 24.93 crore value being an approximate three-year cost _(~1.6% of mcap, our arithmetic)_.","**Garment Mantra Lifestyle** — wins an **export order from Zaara Overseas FZE for polyester printed fabrics and cotton embroidery made-up dress materials**, about Rs 10.37 crore or USD 10,80,920, to be executed by 20 January 2027 _(~16.0% of mcap, our arithmetic)_.","**Mini Diamonds (India)** — secures a **domestic order for cut and polished natural diamonds from an existing Mumbai-based client**, Rs 14.50 crore in the filing against the Rs 14.25 crore and the Aura Diamond name its exchange subject line carries _(~14.6% of mcap, our arithmetic)_.","**Complete Sports and Management India** — takes an **order from a large South India-based company to design, develop and construct what it calls India's first and largest indoor go-karting track**, valued at approximately Rs 24 crore _(~8.1% of mcap)_."],"m_and_a":["**Samvardhana Motherson International** — board approves the purchase, through wholly-owned Samvardhana Motherson Adsys Tech, of **50.1% of Rotary Connectors, which makes military-grade circular connectors for aerospace and defence**, at an enterprise value of Rs 500.4 crore in cash _(~0.3% of mcap)_.","**Himadri Speciality Chemical** — board approves a **scheme of arrangement demerging the tyre business of Dalmia Bharat Refractories into Himadri as a going concern**, with an appointed date of 1 October 2026 and new Himadri shares to be issued to Dalmia Bharat Refractories' shareholders; no value is stated.","**Panorama Studios International** — executes an **assignment agreement with Ultra Media and Entertainment acquiring the dubbing rights to the film 'Anomie — The Equation of Death' in all Indian languages except Tamil, Malayalam, Kannada and Telugu**; no consideration is disclosed."],"capex_core":["**Premier Energies** — **commissions a 7 GW N-type TOPCon G12R solar cell plant at Naidupeta, Andhra Pradesh across 101 acres**, built for about 88,000 cells an hour and taking total cell capacity to 10.6 GW, at a stated capital expenditure of Rs 3,293 crore _(~8.1% of mcap, our arithmetic)_."],"equity_allotments":["**TD Power Systems** — allots **12,50,000 new equity shares at Rs 600 on a preferential basis, Rs 75 crore, to promoters Nikhil Kumar and Mohib Nomanbhai Khericha** following the 10 September shareholder resolution; a fresh allotment, not a warrant conversion _(~0.3% of mcap)_."],"business_updates":["**Results season** — 3 companies filed results / earnings-call material today (press releases, recordings, transcripts, presentations) — tracked in the Results tab, not itemised here.","**Biocon** — subsidiary Biocon Biologics wins a **positive CHMP opinion from the European Medicines Agency recommending marketing authorisation for its pertuzumab biosimilar Pebrilzo in HER2-positive breast cancer**, the first monoclonal antibody biosimilar cleared under the EMA's tailored clinical approach.","**Akiko Global Services** — reports **estimated consolidated turnover of Rs 27.77 crore for August 2026, up 106% year on year**, taking April-August to Rs 121.97 crore against Rs 45.74 crore a year earlier.","**Hy-Tech Engineers** — posts **Q1 FY27 revenue of Rs 43.0 crore, up 13%, and profit after tax of Rs 4.6 crore, up 11%**, and proposes wholly-owned subsidiaries in Delaware and Frankfurt plus about 6.5 acres near Shirwal, Satara.","**Iris Clothings** — enters an **agreement with Amazon to sell its Doreme kidswear range on the platform**, adding to a network of over 140 distributors and retail presence in 26 states; no value is disclosed.","**Persistent Systems** — earns the **Databricks Brickbuilder Specialization for banking, financial services and insurance**, citing a merchant risk and fraud detection solution and more than 1,000 Databricks certifications.","**Desco Infratech** — is **empanelled by the New & Renewable Energy Development Corporation of Andhra Pradesh as an approved supplier of 1 KWp to 500 KWp grid-connected rooftop solar plants**; the filing states this is not itself an award of any project or order.","**Smarten Power Systems** — unveils **seven power products at REV Expo Lucknow**, spanning hybrid, on-grid and backup applications and including the in-house On-Grid Star 3 kW, and reports about 10,000 visitors across the three days."],"distress_risk":["**Dai-Ichi Karkaria** — receives an **income-tax penalty order under section 270A of Rs 15.18 lakh for assessment year 2024-25**, on Rs 90.93 lakh treated as under-reported income, and says it will appeal to the Commissioner (Appeals)."]},"theme_titles":{"order_wins":"Order wins (notable vs mcap)","m_and_a":"M&A / restructuring","capex_core":"Capex (core / topline)","equity_allotments":"Equity allotments (new)","business_updates":"Business updates","distress_risk":"Distress & risk"},"theme_rows":{"order_wins":[{"mcap":null},{"label":"DBL","ticker":"DBL","company":"Dilip Buildcon Ltd","isin":"INE917M01012","pdf_link":"https://www.bseindia.com/xml-data/corpfiling/AttachLive/60148df3-458e-48a2-b394-a32856fb57e8.pdf","m